   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1793180000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "MCTQ: SD = giờ dậy − giờ ngủ · MS = giữa giấc · SDweek =\n(SDw·WD + SDf·(7 − WD)) / 7 · MSFsc = MSF − (SDf − SDweek) / 2\nkhi có ngủ bù",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
